+# Rust native bindings audit — evidence dependency checkpoint
+
+2026-10-14 · WO-RUST-NATIVE-BINDINGS-AUDIT-01 · Apple Silicon / macOS 13+
+
+The **16-package published-manifest closure is resolved**. Adoption readiness
+remains gated by referenced upstream license grant/notice texts, SDK licensing
+and an explicit foreign-exception boundary decision. Exact license requests are
+in `artifacts/WO-RUST-NATIVE-BINDINGS-AUDIT-01/needed-primary-inputs.json`.
+No dependency adoption, compilation, native implementation or runtime acceptance
